Invoice <%= @invoice.invoice_number %>
==================================

Dear <%= @client.name %>,

Attached is your invoice from <%= @account.business_name %> for <%= number_to_currency(@invoice.total_amount, unit: @invoice.currency_symbol) %>.

Invoice #: <%= @invoice.invoice_number %>
